Micha Pringle <michapringle@yahoo.com> deserves a cookie for saying:
> 1. First drink on a fountain can give a stat boost (1/7 chance iirc).
> This applies to the first drink only, so when I am strong enough, I go
> back to all the fountains and take 1 sip.

Incorrect in parts.  Each fountain has a 1/7 chance of being magic.  If
you quaff from a magic fountain with non-negative luck, you have a 30%
chance of getting "The cool draught refreshes you" and a 70% chance of
gaining a point in one stat (if your luck is < 4) or all stats (if your
luck is >= 4).  If you gain the stats, the fountain is no longer magic.

Regardless of whether it's magic or not, there's a 1/3 chance of the
fountain drying up on each quaff (unless you're in minetown). 

